/// Definition: A person set up in Visual Care, the rostering system, so they can be given shifts. Workers are linked to employees by payroll ID. In this report: worker records with their onboarding milestones, one row per worker record, from the worker milestones view in L4_Analytical.
/// For analysis: Joins DimEmployee on payroll ID (many-to-many) and FactWorkerRoster on Id Worker. Milestone dates use inactive joins to DimEmployeeTenureDate.
table DimWorker
	lineageTag: 37627b8c-6d28-4bbd-bcc8-720cd62a748c

	/// Definition: Worker identifier from the rostering system.
